# Utility Functions and Technical Analysis

ChainerTrader provides a comprehensive set of utility functions and technical analysis tools in the [src/trader/utils/](mdc:src/trader/utils) module.

## Technical Analysis Utilities

### Trend Analysis
- **Trend Detection**: [src/trader/utils/trend.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/trend.py) - Trend identification and classification
- **Pivot Points**: [src/trader/utils/pivot.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/pivot.py) - Support and resistance calculations
- **Inflection Points**: [src/trader/utils/inflectionpoint.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/inflectionpoint.py) - Market turning point detection

### Indicator Utilities
- **RSI Calculations**: [src/trader/utils/chainerrsi.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/chainerrsi.py) - Relative Strength Index implementations
- **KDJ Oscillator**: [src/trader/utils/kdj.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/kdj.py) - KDJ indicator calculations
- **RSRS Analysis**: [src/trader/utils/rsrs.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/rsrs.py) - RSRS (Relative Strength of Relative Strength) calculations

### Data Processing
- **Kline Utilities**: [src/trader/utils/kline.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/kline.py) - Candlestick data processing
- **Symbol Management**: [src/trader/utils/symbol_interval.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/symbol_interval.py) - Trading pair and interval handling
- **Top Analysis**: [src/trader/utils/top.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/top.py) - Peak and trough identification

## Performance Analysis

### Profit/Loss Calculations
- **Profit/Loss Ratio**: [src/trader/utils/profitlossratio.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/profitlossratio.py) - Risk/reward ratio calculations
- **Win Rate Analysis**: [src/trader/utils/winrate.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/winrate.py) - Trading success rate metrics

### Operation Management
- **Operation State**: [src/trader/utils/operation_state.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/operation_state.py) - Trade state management
- **Operation Utilities**: [src/trader/utils/operate.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/operate.py) - Trade execution helpers

## Data Management

### Symbol and Interval Handling
- **Symbol Interval**: [src/trader/utils/symbol_interval.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/symbol_interval.py) - Individual symbol/interval pairs
- **Symbols Interval**: [src/trader/utils/symbols_interval.py](mdc:src/trader/utils/symbols_interval.py) - Multiple symbol/interval management

## Common Utilities

### Configuration and Paths
- **Common Functions**: [src/trader/common/common.py](mdc:src/trader/common/common.py) - Shared utility functions
